{'symbol': 'JBHT', 'date': '2023-04-27 15:11:00', 'title': 'J. B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'LOWELL, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. (NASDAQ:JBHT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $ 0.42 (FORTY TWO CENTS) PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 12, 2023 AND WILL BE PAID ON MAY 26, 2023. ABOUT J.B. HUNT J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC., AN S&P 500 COMPANY, PROVIDES INNOVATIVE SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS FOR A VARIETY OF CUSTOMERS THROUGHOUT NORTH AMER.'}